-- statement:
--   Under the explicit startup inequalities, every discarded source code
--   is either a late-first-odd code or lies in a whole-shell parity tail.
--
--   Source: https://github.com/shaikidris/CollatzEndpointTransport-Palomar/blob/9505e8fd59f2b49a2dad269436766319c57b4012/CollatzEndpointTransport/Linear/CentralRenyiShell.lean#L955-L1002
